## Topics

Topics are a curated keyword vocabulary in [`notes/topics.tsv`](../topics.tsv) (the hand-written source of truth, with the reading verdict for each term in [`notes/topics.md`](../topics.md)), measured over four texts per family: title, abstract, scope note, and the derived Lean file paths. A family carries zero or more topics, so this is a label on top of the discipline partition, not a replacement for it. {{ n_topic }} terms, {{ n_assign }} assignments, {{ n_nohit }} terms with no hit.

